    {
      "id": "7b88ce7e-3c52-438b-936a-40f574a8a343",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        560,
        432
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 352,
        "height": 432,
        "content": "This node watches Google Sheets for new patient appointment form submissions.\nWhenever a new patient submits the form, the workflow starts automatically."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7394f5ad-7cff-4523-9024-567daa4d31e8",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        960,
        432
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 896,
        "height": 432,
        "content": "## Patient Data Processing & Availability Check\n\nThis section prepares and organizes patient appointment details received from the form.\nIt converts the appointment date and time into calendar format and checks doctor availability in Google Calendar.\nIf the selected slot is available, the workflow continues with appointment booking.\nIf the slot is already booked, the patient receives an unavailable appointment email."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ba557ff2-e890-434f-bc2f-8a9b93b7cb62",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1904,
        912
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "This node sends an email to the patient if the selected appointment slot is already booked."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b6a9edb6-690f-4ecb-99a0-ec3dad3d0ab1",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1904,
        416
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 976,
        "height": 448,
        "content": "## Appointment Booking & Confirmation Process\n\nThis section creates the patient appointment in Google Calendar after the slot is confirmed. The workflow then prepares and stores all appointment details securely in the Supabase database. Finally, a confirmation email is automatically sent to the patient with appointment information."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e6c167ba-1eb7-4ef0-84c8-e9c21c791c08",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2912,
        416
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 688,
        "height": 448,
        "content": "## Appointment Reminder & Status Tracking\n\nThis section automatically sends a reminder email to the patient before the appointment time. After the reminder is sent successfully, the workflow updates the appointment status in Supabase. This helps the clinic track reminder activity and manage appointments more efficiently."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "28308970-bf04-420b-9ab1-a7b3e7490166",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -208,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 720,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "## How it works\n\nThis workflow automatically manages patient appointments using Google Forms, Google Calendar, Gmail, and Supabase. When a patient submits an appointment form, the workflow collects and cleans the patient details, then checks doctor availability in Google Calendar.\n\nIf the selected time slot is available, the system creates the appointment event in Google Calendar, stores all appointment details in Supabase database, and sends a confirmation email to the patient. Before the appointment time, the workflow automatically sends a reminder email and updates the reminder status in the database for tracking purposes.\n\n\n## Setup Steps\n\n**1.** Create a Google Form for patient appointment booking.\n**2.** Connect Google Sheets Trigger in n8n to capture form responses.\n**3.** Configure Google Calendar credentials for appointment scheduling.\n**4.** Create a Supabase project and appointment table for data storage.\n**5.** Connect Gmail credentials for confirmation and reminder emails.\n**6.** Configure the Wait node timing for appointment reminders.\n**7.** Test the workflow using sample patient appointments before enabling production mode."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
